erson in the next 12 months?",helper:"Your answer updates the loss probability on this person's record when you finish the evaluation."},section:{title:"Loss risk",subtitle:"Chance of leaving"},dragInstruction:"Drag the marker to indicate the probability. The matching band appears here with a description of what it means.",ranges:{very_low:{name:"Very low",signals:"Engaged and stable · Satisfied and connected · No signs of searching",description:"I see satisfaction, belonging and motivation. I find no signs that this person is looking at other opportunities."},low:{name:"Low",signals:"Mostly satisfied · Satisfied with reservations · Subtle, isolated signs",description:"I see overall satisfaction, with moments of questioning. I notice subtle, isolated signs of curiosity about the market."},moderate:{name:"Moderate",signals:"Unstable satisfaction · Fluctuating engagement · Likely watching the market",description:"I see fragile satisfaction and belonging. I sense this person may be considering other possibilities."},high:{name:"High",signals:"Visible dissatisfaction · Hardly satisfied · Consistent signs of searching",description:"I see dissatisfaction and low belonging day to day. I sense this person is actively considering leaving."},critical:{name:"Critical",signals:"Emotionally disengaged · Clearly dissatisfied · Departure very likely",description:"I strongly believe this person has already decided to leave or is very close to it."}}}}},Qle={en:{translations:{previous:"Previous",goToPayments:"Go to payment",filter:{placeholder:"Your courses",all:"All",courses:"Courses",learningPaths:"Learning paths",status:"Subscription status",confirmed:"Confirmed",pending:"Pending"},filterPanel:{resultFor:"Results for ",searchResults:"These are the results according to your search.",searchForTitleOrCategory:"Search by title or category",selectValue:"Select a value",courses:"Courses",back:"Back"},banner:{watchNow:"Watch now"},interests:{tooltip:"Interests",disabledButton:"No catego