ould not find this CNPJ. This content only accepts enrollments from companies already registered.",blockedNextTooltip:"This content is blocked for the informed company.",recognizedWithDiscount:"Company already registered in this environment — {{percentage}}% off on this course.",recognizedWithoutDiscount:"Company already registered in this environment — no discount configured for this course."},subscriptionError:"Unable to complete the registration"},attachmentStep:{attachmentRequired:"there is an attachment required to view this content.",attachment:"Attachment",cantBeBlank:"Attachment cannot be empty."},menuFilterSelect:{advancedFilters:"+ Advanced filters",selectFilter:"Select a filter",fastFilter:"Fast filter",searchPlaceholder:"Search a filter by name"},journeys:{sectionTitle:"Journeys",internal:{back_to_play:"Back to Play",back_to_card:"Back to details",badge:"Journey",available_from:"Available from",no_phase:"No phase",no_tasks_title:"This journey has no tasks yet",no_tasks_description:"When this journey has tasks in its schedule, they show up here.",not_available:"Could not load the journey.",task_types:{learning:"Learning",appointment:"Appointment",manual:"Manual",message:"Message"}},detailedCard:{notInformed:"Not informed",duration:"Duration:",includes:"This journey includes:",tasks_one:"{{count}} task",tasks_other:"{{count}} tasks",durationUnit:{days_one:"day",days_other:"days",weeks_one:"week",weeks_other:"weeks",months_one:"month",months_other:"months"},tabs:{details:"Details",schedule:"Schedule"},button:{subscribe:"Subscribe",access:"Access",enrolled_success:"Enrolled successfully"},schedule:{empty:"No tasks registered.",situation:{completed:"Completed",in_progress:"In progress",pending:"Pending"}}}}}}},Kle={en:{translations:{failure:{invalid:"Invalid login or password."},shared:{forgotYourPassword:"Forgot your password?",resendConfirmationEmail:"Didn't receive confirmation instructions?",passwordPlaceholder:"Password",loginPlaceholder:"Login"},sessions:{signIn:"Sign in",signInWith:"Sign in with:"},registrations:{signUp:"Sign up"}}}},Jle={en:{translations:{modal:{title:"Become a BETA tester and discover our new feature first-hand",coolIWannaTest:"Join the BETA",continueWithoutTesting:"Continue without testing",howWorks:"How does a beta test work?",collapseText:{paragraph1:{start:"By becoming a",betaTester:"BETA tester",end:", you will be able to use this functionality first-hand and contribute to its evolution. And don't worry, you can leave the test whenever you want."},paragraph2:{important:"Important:",start:" this functionality is being made available as a",beta:"BETA",end:". At the end of the testing cycle, access will be automatically suspended and the functionality may be linked to a specific plan."}},weAreSoExcited:"We are very excited to announce that",areHereToExplore:"is available for testing! We would like to invite you to be a BETA tester of this new feature 🚀",introduction:"We are excited to invite you to participate in the",introductionBeta:"BETA",introductionEnd:" of the functionality, which allows you to define when users can access the platform and content 🚀",attention:{one:"👉 Attention:",two:" by accepting, this feature will be",three:" enabled for your entire environment",four:" so you can experience it for free during the exclusive beta period."},features:{treinamentos:"Training records",competencias:"Skills",facelift_edicao_de_conteudos:"Facelift edition of contents",nova_carga_horaria:"customization of experience type and workload in minutes",horario_de_acesso:"Access schedule",assinatura_no_certificado:"Signature on certificate",paineis_do_usuario:"User panels",registros_avaliacao:"Learning records"},singleFeatureDetails:{registros_avaliacao:{title:"Be a BETA tester and get to know Learning records first-hand",customIntroduction:[{text:"We are inviting you to the "},{text:"Learning records BETA",bold:!0},{text:": the hub to track, validate and export everything your team learns, inside and outside Twygo."}],feature1:{title:"📊 Full environment overview:",description:"Track issued, pending, expired and rejected records in a dashboard, with the complete list in one place."},feature2:{title:"✅ In-flow validation:",description:"Approve or reject pending external records and register experiences for any collaborator."},feature3:{title:"📦 Bulk export:",description:"Export records and evidence at once; you get a notification as soon as the package is ready."},betaWarning:"As a BETA version, it may receive adjustments over time. At the end of the period, a quick feedback form will be made available"},paineis_do_usuario:{customIntroduction:[{text:"We invite you to participate in the "},{text:"BETA",bold:!0},{text:" of "},{text:"User panels",bold:!0},{text:", a new "},{text:"dashboard",bold:!0},{text:" experience, now built with a more flexible structure based on "},{text:"widgets",bold:!0},{text:" 🚀"}],feature1:{title:"📊 New dashboard with more organization:",description:"We restructured the user dashboard, keeping the main information such as progress, certificates, content in progress and ranking, now in a more organized and adaptable format."},feature2:{title:"🧩 Panel management:",description:{text1:"Access the ",bold1:"Panels",text2:" tab, in the navigation settings, to organize, reorder and structure the dashboard information, including the creation of tabs."}}},horario_de_acesso:{feature1:{icon:"schedule",title:"⏰ Access schedule control by use mode:",description:{text1:"it is now possible to define ",bold1:"days",text2:" and ",bold2:"access times",text3:" for users, according to the use mode defined in your environment."}},feature2:{icon:"lock",title:"🔒 Restriction outside schedule:",description:{text1:"outside the configured schedule, access can be ",bold1:"blocked",text2:" ",bold2:"automatically",text3:", ensuring more control over platform usage."}}},analise_creditos_ia_beta_test:{feature1:{title:"💡 More practical AI credit control:",description:"You can now select which AI features to use in your organization and easily monitor credit usage, including available balance and consumption history."}}},betaWarning:"As this is a BETA version, adjustments may occur during use.",betaWarningSecond:"Your experience is very important and at the end of the testing period, a brief feedback form",betaWarningThird:"will be made available",multipleFeatures:{introduction:"We are excited to invite you to participate in the BETA of two improvements that make content management even more flexible and precise 🚀",collapseText:"By becoming a BETA tester, you can contribute to the development of the new feature, trying it out first-hand and sharing your opinion on what can be improved. And don't worry, you can leave the test whenever you want.",collapseAttention:{bold:"Attention:",text:"By participating, these functionalities will be",boldText:"activated for your entire environment",text2:", allowing you to use and evaluate them freely during this testing period."},features:{experienceTypeCustomization:{title:"Experience type customization",description:{text1:"Now you can define how content will be identified in your environment, choosing exactly how the student views each content. With the new ",bold:'"Experience type"',text2:" field, it is possible to customize labels such as ",italic:"Workshop, Masterclass, Bootcamp, Ebook",text3:", among others, going beyond standard formats."},description_bottom:"👉 This label is visible to the student in the content catalog, facilitating the understanding of the experience offered."},configurableWorkload:{title:"Configurable workload in minutes",description:"The workload configuration is now more precise! Now it is possible to define the content time in minutes, and not just in hours."}}}},notification:{youAreInTheMode:"You are in the mode",ofFuncionality:"of functionality",whichGoesUpTo:"which goes up to",betaEndDate:"11/20",interruptBetaTest:"Interrupt BETA test",answerResearch:"Answer research"},survey:{satisfactionLevel:"What is your satisfaction level with the functionality in relation to:",veryInSatisfied:"Very unsatisfied",inSatisfied:"Unsatisfied",neutral:"Neutral",satisfied:"Satisfied",verySatisfied:"Very satisfied",title:{onlyFeedback:"Tell us about your experience",beforeCancel:"Before canceling the BETA test, tell us about your experience",endOfBeta:"The BETA test of the functionality",endOfBetaEnd:"has come to an end! Tell us how was your experience "},buttonText:{onlyFeedback:"Submit responses",beforeCancel:"Submit and interrupt the test",endOfBeta:"Submit"},questions:{userXP:"User experience?",contributionToImproveManagement:"Contribution to improve the management of your courses/corporate university?",contributionToImproveLearningExperience:"Contribution to improve the students' learning experience?",contributionToIncreaseEngagement:"Contribution to increase student engagement?",contributionToFacilitateCreation:"Contribution to facilitate the creation of new content?",somethingToBeFixed:"Is there anything that needs to be fixed before launching this functionality?",somethingToBeImproved:"Is there any improvement you would like to suggest for the future, for the evolution of the functionality?",leaveAMessage:"Would you like to leave a message for our development team?",placeholder:{writeYourCommentHere:"Write your comment here"},reaminingCharacters:"Remaining characters"},feedback:{message:"Thank you for participating in the test!",messageEndOfBeta:"Thank you for sharing your opinion with us!",submessage:"You will be able to continue using the new functionality until {{date}}.",submessageEnd:"We will inform you shortly about the official launch!"}},faceliftPages:{description:{1:"We redesigned some things here to make your day even easier.",2:"You will have more filters, dashboards, simple data extraction and bulk actions in several areas: “Contents”, “Users”, “Questions”, “Learning” and “Team”."}}}}},Xle={en:{translations:{contentType:{cours