der",evaluation:"Evaluation · {{type}}",pdi:"IDP",closing:"Closing (final score)"},optional:{title:"Optional stages",subtitle:"select what your cycle uses",calibration:{label:"9-box calibration",badge:"exclusive to the Performance Evaluation",blockedText:"9-box calibration positions people by the performance score — it is only available when the Performance Evaluation is in the cycle."},pdi:{label:"Individual Development Plan (IDP)",subtitle:"development plan stage after the results — no respondent collection"}},closingModel:{title:"Closing model",subtitle:"how the final score is defined",weighted:{label:"Automatic calculation (average of scores)",tooltip:"Average of the respondents' scores, weighted by respondent type and, when defined, by the weights for each respondent type."},leaderAdoption:{label:"Automatic - leader score only",tooltip:"The final score is the score the leader gave in the evaluation. Self and peers count only as reference."},consensus:{label:"Consensus (leader and employee)",tooltip:"The leader fills out the evaluation in consensus together with the employee. This result becomes the final score. The employee must confirm the consensus took place, with the option to agree or disagree."}},feedback:{toggle:"Include cycle feedback",subtitle:"written feedback from the leader after the scores are consolidated",badge:"exclusive to the Performance Evaluation",blockedText:"Cycle feedback is the leader's written feedback at closing — it is only available when the Performance Evaluation is in the cycle."},divergence:{toggle:"Include large divergence flagging",subtitle:"highlights evaluations with a large gap between reviewers",tooltip:"Flags when scores from different reviewers diverge a lot."}},results:{divergence:{title:"Divergence threshold between evaluations",tooltip:"When two evaluations of the same session differ by more than this threshold (regardless of who evaluated), the consolidation highlights the divergence. It does not change who responds — 