nswers.",research:"Create and manage your surveys — Questionnaires without answer keys, focused on collecting responses.",assessment:"Create and manage your assessments — Questionnaires with weights and proving criteria per alternative."}},list:{fields:{name:"Name",questionsCount:"Number of questions",usableIn:"Can be used in",createdAt:"Created at",updatedAt:"Updated at"},usableInValues:{performance:"Performance review",competency:"Competency assessment",effectiveness:"Effectiveness assessment"},actions:{new:{exam:"New exam",research:"New survey",assessment:"New assessment"},edit:"Edit",delete:"Delete",test:"Test",confirmDestroyMessage:"This action cannot be undone. Are you sure you want to delete this questionnaire?",successDestroyMessage:"Questionnaire deleted successfully",errorDestroyMessage:"Error deleting questionnaire"},stats:{totalLabel:{exam:"Exams",research:"Surveys",assessment:"Assessments"},questionsEnabled:"Enabled questions",loadError:"Error loading stats"},empty:{exam:"No exams registered",research:"No surveys registered",assessment:"No assessments registered"}},edit:{title:{exam:"Edit exam",research:"Edit survey",assessment:"Edit assessment"},newTitle:{exam:"Create exam",research:"Create survey",assessment:"Create assessment"},defaults:{categories1Label:"Categories 1",categories2Label:"Categories 2",aiAnalysisPrompt:"Take the questionnaire responses that are already saved and give me a report that is straight to the point. I would like you to bring a summary right away for the employee. At the end, a short paragraph bringing together the main strengths and points of attention of this person based on the responses.",aiChatPrompt:`Always be respectful, welcoming and encouraging. Use clear and accessible language, avoiding jargon without explanation. Maintain a didactic pace: present concepts, ask if it was clear and offer practical examples.

Relate theory and practice: propose small exercises or reflections after each explanation. Encourage questions and self-assessments; offer constructive feedback.

When the student asks a question, answer directly and complement with extra resources (links, reading suggestions, analogies). Stimulate participation, for example: "How do you perceive this trait in yourself?" or "Can you think of a real example?". Prefer everyday examples (teamwork, daily work).

Recognize successes and advances: "Good observation!", "Great reflection!" and guide how to deepen: "To explore this trait further, you can...". Only talk to them about subjects that are related to the proposed topic, never talk about other subjects different from the topic and do not use profanity.`,section:"New section",question:"Question",option:"Option {{number}}",scaleLevels:{0:"Does not meet",1:"Developing",2:"Meets",3:"Exceeds",4:"Role model"}},scale:{title:"Scale",tooltip:"Defines the score range used by every Scale question in this questionnaire — the number of each level is the score given to the person being evaluated. The range can start at 0. The label and the description of each level are written in each question.",from:"From",to:"to",fromLabel:"Scale start",toLabel:"Scale end",classification:{title:"Score classification",tooltip:"Tell whether each score of the scale is negative, neutral or positive. The effectiveness indicators use this classification to split the answers, even across scales of different sizes.",negative:"Negative",neutral:"Neutral",positive:"Positive",missing:"Classify the scores {{values}}"}},fields:{name:"Name",categories1Label:"Category 1",categories2Label:"Category 2",categories1LabelName:"Category name",categories2LabelName:"Category name",categories1Items:"Categories",categories2Items:"Categories",commentsGroup:"Comments",aiAnalysisGroup:"AI analysis",canComment:"Allow participants to comment on questions",canInstructorOpinion:"Allow instructor feedback",enableAiAnalysis:"Enable AI analysis generation at the end of the questionnaire",aiAnalysisPrompt:"Prompt (Generation instruction)",enableAiChat:"Enable AI chat",aiChatPrompt:"Instructions on how the chat should behave",usableIn:"Can be used in"},placeholder:{name:"Type the questionnaire name",categoryItems:"Type a category and press Enter",aiAnalysisPrompt:"Type the instructions for the analysis generation.",aiChatPrompt:"Define how the chat should behave with respondents."},tooltips:{categories:"Categories organize questions by theme. When linking a questionnaire to a content, you can choose from which categories questions should be shown.",canComment:"If enabled, a comment box will be shown below each question, allowing the participant to share their observations.",canInstructorOpinion:"If enabled, the user grading the questionnaire (Instructor, Class manager or Administrator) can add comments during grading.",enableAiAnalysis:"When the questionnaire is completed, an intelligent report will be generated based on the user answers and the inserted prompt.",aiAnalysisPrompt:"Clearly provide instructions for the artificial intelligence to perform the analysis. Also detail the information and formats to be presented in the report.",enableAiChat:"Enable AI chat to allow participants to interact with a chat to help them learn.",aiChatPrompt:"Restrict certain topics, adapt the desired communication.",usableIn:"Indicates in which assessment processes this assessment can be applied. Use it to organize and filter assessments when configuring an evaluation cycle — only assessments marked with the right type will appear as options.",defineSectionWeights:"When on, you set each section weight in the final score (the sum must reach 100%). When off, all sections weigh the same.",defineQuestionWeights:"When on, you set each question weight within the group (the sum must reach 100%). When off, all questions weigh the same."},buttons:{save:"Save",cancel:"Cancel",preview:"Preview"},sections:{identification:"Identification",categories:"Categories",questions:"Questions",sectionsTitle:"Sections",defineSectionWeights:"Set section weights",defineQuestionWeights:"Set question weights",sectionWeightsSum:"Sum of section weights",questionWeightsSum:"Sum of question weights",flatHint:"Questions stay in a single list. Create sections only if you want to group them.",comments:"Comments",aiAnalysis:"AI analysis"},messages:{saveSuccess:"Questionnaire saved successfully"