d, the user who grades the quiz (Instructor, Class Manager, or Administrator) will be able to add comments to the grade.",enable_ai_analysis:"At the end of the questionnaire, an intelligent report will be generated based on the questionnaire responses made by the user and the prompt entered.",ai_analysis_prompt:"Clearly provide instructions for the artificial intelligence to perform the analysis. Also detail the information and formats to be presented in the report.",enable_ai_chat:"Enable AI chat to allow participants to interact with a chat to help them learn.",ai_chat_prompt:"Restrict certain topics, adapt the desired communication."},placeholders:{category_1_label:"Type the name of the set",categories:"Type the category names separated by commas or by clicking + Add"},validations:{is_required:"{{field}} is mandatory and cannot be empty"},default_values:{ai_analysis_prompt:"Take the questionnaire responses that are already saved and give me a report that is straight to the point. I would like you to bring a summary right away for the employee. At the end, a short paragraph bringing together the main strengths and points of attention of this person based on the responses.",ai_chat_prompt:`Always be respectful, welcoming and encouraging. Use clear and accessible language, avoiding jargon without explanation. Maintain a didactic pace: present concepts, ask if it was clear and offer practical examples. 

Relate theory and practice: propose small exercises or reflections after each explanation. Encourage questions and self-assessments; offer constructive feedback. 

When the student asks a question, answer directly and complement with extra resources (links, reading suggestions, analogies). Stimulate participation, for example: How do you perceive this trait in yourself? or Can you think of a real example? Prefer everyday examples (teamwork, daily work). 

Recognize successes and advances: Good observation!, Great reflection! and guide how to deepen: To explore this trait further, you can . Only talk to them about subjects that are related to the proposed topic, never talk about other subjects different from the topic and do not use profanity.`}},list:{fields:{name:"Questionnaire",type:"Type",number_of_question:"Number of questions",types:{exam:"Test",research:"Research"}},actions:{cant_destroy:"Cannot delete questionnaire in use",questions:"Questions",destroyMessage:"The questionnaire and its questions will be deleted. This action cannot be undone. Are you sure you want to delete it?",successDestroyMessage:"Questionnaire deleted successfully"}},questionFormat:{scale:"Range of values",multiple:"Multiple choice",text:"Text",file:"File",single:"Single"},questions:{formatOption:"Option {{number}}",add:"Add",search:"Search by question",enabledTooltip:"Whether the question is enabled or not. Disabled questions are not displayed to participants.",columns:{formatLabel:"Format",titleLabel:"Question",answerLabel:"Answer",categoryLabel:"Category",explanation:"Explanation",additionalConfigurationLabel:"Additional configuration",orderLabel:"Order",enabledLabel:"Enabled"},enabledToggleSuccess:"Question enabled successfully",notEnabledToggleSuccess:"Question disabled successfully",destroyMessage:"The question will be deleted. This action cannot be undone and will be completed when 'Save' is clicked.",question:"Question: ",cantDestroyTooltipLabel:"Cannot delete answered questions",copyQuestions:"Copy questions",canTakeAMinute:"This can take a minute",beingCopied:"Questions are being copied",copySuccess:"Questions copied successfully",copyQuestionSave:"Save",copy:"Copy",form:{labels:{kind:"Format",title:"Question",description:"Description",initial_scale:"Initial value",final_scale:"Final value",categories1:"Category 1",categories2:"Category 2",categoriesTooltip:"Categories organize questions by topic. When linking a quiz to content, 