racters."},objective:{max:"The objective must have at most 255 characters."}},buttons:{save:"Save",cancel:"Cancel"},placeholders:{saveFirst:"Save the model identification to unlock this tab.",comingSoon:"Configuration available soon."},messages:{saved:"Effectiveness model saved successfully."}},scope:{question:"What does this model evaluate?",scopeTypes:{experienceType:"Experience type",specificContent:"Specific content"},experienceTypes:{label:"Experience types",placeholder:"Select the types",tooltip:"Only internal courses are eligible. The experience type is set when a course is created. The selection applies to contents already published and to contents created later with this experience type."},ignoredCourses:{label:"Contents to ignore",placeholder:"No ignored contents",tooltip:"Remove from the scope the courses of these experience types that should not be measured by this model. Ignoring keeps the history already collected; removing from the list includes the course again."},courseKind:"Course",courses:{title:"Evaluated contents",count_one:"{{count}} linked",count_other:"{{count}} linked",add:"Add",remove:"Remove course",columns:{kind:"Type",experienceType:"Experience type",content:"Content",situation:"Status"}},coursesModal:{title:"Contents",subtitle:"Select the contents evaluated by this effectiveness model",searchPlaceholder:"Search by name or ID",cancel:"Cancel",apply:"Apply",empty:"No courses found."},validation:{scopeType:{required:"Choose what the model evaluates."},experienceTypes:{required:"Select at least one experience type."},courses:{required:"Add at least one course."}}},levels:{questionList:{placeholder:"Select an assessment",create:"Create assessment"},reaction:{title:"Level 1 · Reaction",description:"What the participant thought, right after completing the content.",mode:{stars:{title:"Stars and comment"},custom:{title:"Custom assessment"}},required:{label:"Answer required",tooltip:"When unchecked, the assessment is an invitation — it does not create a pending task or reminders."},label:{label:"Activity label during execution",tooltip:"Tag the learner sees in the content for this level's assessments. If you clear it, it goes back to “Training effectiveness”.",default:"Training effectiveness"}},behavior:{title:"Level 3 · Behavior",description:"Autopilot: when triggered, the assessments of the selected sides are sent — the leader one, about the behavior they observe in the employee, and the employee one, of self-perception. The trigger counts from the content completion.",respondents:{title:"Who answers",manager:{label:"Leader",hint:"(direct manager)"},self:{label:"Self-assessment",hint:"(employee)"}},sides:{manager:{title:"Assessment answered by the leader",tooltip:"What the leader observes in the employee behavior change.",dueDays:"Leader completion deadline"},self:{title:"Assessment answered by the employee",tooltip:"Self-perception of who took the training, to compare with the leader reading.",dueDays:"Employee completion deadline"}},dueDays:{tooltip:"How many days this respondent has to answer, counted from the trigger. Once the deadline passes, the assessment closes and no longer accepts answers.",suffix:"days after sending"},triggerDays:{label:"When to send",tooltip:"How many days after the employee completes the content the assessments are sent. It is sent only once.",suffix:"days after the employee completes the content"},closingMethod:{title:"Closing method",tooltip:"How the leader observation and the employee self-perception become a single score.",inertReason:"Available when both the leader and the self-assessment answer — with a single side there are no two readings to close.",consensusMismatchAlert:"With consensus, the leader and the employee answer the same assessment so they can agree question by question. Choose the same assessment on both sides.",options:{average:{title:"Automatic calculation (average of scores)"},leaderOnly:{title:"Leader score only"},consensus:{title:"Consensus (leader a