Public Everyone can view, including visitors without login.`,require_confirmation:"If enabled, it will require the administrator to confirm the enrollment of each participant who signs up for the package.",allow_group_registration:"Enabling this option allows a person to acquire multiple registrations of a single content at once, through a group of registrations.",allow_subscription_by:"Restricts who can register for this content: companies, physical persons or both. This configuration affects the registration screen: if both options are selected, it will be requested from the user to choose between a physical person or a company during registration.",restrict_access_period:"When enabled, you can set specific dates and times for content access start and end.",datetime_start:"Defines when access to the content will be released for users. Before this time, enrollment can still be performed, but the content remains unavailable for viewing.",datetime_end:"Defines until when the content will be accessible to users. After this date and time, the content situation is automatically changed to Suspended.",workload:"Enter workload in HHHH:MM:SS format (hours:minutes:seconds)",notify_on_first_activity:"An email will be sent to the contact configured in this content when users complete the first activity.",notify_on_release:"An email will be sent to all active users in your environment informing about the release of this content.",classification:"Define a classification that complements the identification of this content. It can be used as a filter and will help users find items with similar characteristics. Examples: Basic, Advanced, Live Event.",experience_type:"Choose the label that best represents this content for your users. It serves to personalize the way your users will see and recognize the content, functioning as an identifier of the experience type. Examples: Course, Transmission, Materials."},options:{outlet:{in_company:"In-Company",open:"Open",other:"Other"},event_