ion available"},roleQuantity:{label:"Number of business roles",tooltip:"Inform how many business roles you want to generate for this area.",placeholder:"Ex: 5"},additionalDocuments:{label:"Document upload",tooltip:"Upload extra documents so AI can generate more specific and contextualized business roles."},additionalInformation:{label:"Additional information",tooltip:"Add extra context AI should consider when generating business roles.",placeholder:"Ex: We need business roles for different seniority levels, including leadership positions."},prompt:{title:"Generation settings (Default prompt)",label:"Default prompt",tooltip:"Define formatting and structure instructions for AI (writing style, text size and use of topics). These instructions will be saved as default for all environment generations, ensuring uniformity; avoid area-specific content, which should be in additional instructions.",placeholder:"Enter the default prompt for business role generation...",defaultInstructions:`Use verbs in the infinitive to describe responsibilities.
