n:"Enter description",providerWebsite:"https://example.com",search:"Search by person or content",searchAdmin:"Search by person, content or provider",searchStudent:"Search by content, origin or provider",searchProviders:"Search providers",workload_seconds:"HH:MM:SS"},tooltips:{website:`Link to the website where the external content was taken. Ex: https://www.udemy.com/course/design-thinking/
