https://www.amazon.com/strategic-leadership`,evidence:"Upload files that prove participation or completion of the training. Ex: Certificate of completion (PDF or image); Proof of registration or attendance; Screenshot of Youtube video.",people:"People who completed the external training. You can search by name, CPF, email, area and role. Person is the user in the system.",content:"Name of the training, course, video, article, book, mentoring, coaching, workshop or event.",origin:`Defines where the learning record comes from:
- Internal: created and completed within the platform
- External: performed outside the platform
- Shared: imported or integrated from another environment`,providerColumn:"Name of the institution, platform or company that offered the content",experienceColumn:"Type of activity performed. You can register what you need, such as Training, Book, Article, Video, Mentoring, Coaching among others.",categories:"Categories related to the content. Use semicolon (;) to separate different categories and comma (,) to insert them.",workload:"Total duration of the training in hours (ex: 3). If the content was submitted via website or file, AI can suggest the estimated workload automatically.",grade:"Final performance or concept received by the employee (ex: 85). If the website or files were submitted, AI can identify and fill this field automatically.",progress:"How much of the content you have completed.",closingDate:"Date on which access to the content is scheduled to end, after which learning can no longer continue.",contentValue:"Enter the amount paid for the external content or course, if applicable. If it is free, leave it blank or enter '0'.",competencies:"Competency developed by the employee by completing this training (ex: Leadership, Sales, Excel). If the website or files are submitted, AI can automatically suggest related competencies.",workload_seconds:"Total duration of the training in HH:MM:SS format. If the content was submitted via website or file, AI can suggest the estimated workload automatically.",situation:`Record stage.
External:
· Awaiting confirmation (submitted by the learner)
· Approved
· Rejected
Internal/Shared:
· Awaiting confirmation
· Confirmed
· In progress
· Completed
· Approved
· Finished (closing date passed without completion)
· Cancelled`,certificate:`Platform certificate status (internal/shared records).
· Completion pending: content in progress or criteria not yet met.
· Awaiting issuance: criteria met, certificate queued or awaiting manual issuance.
· Issued
· Expired
· Replaced
· Not enabled: the content does not generate a certificate.
External records always show "—" (we do not control whether the evidence is a certificate).`,startDateInternal:"For internal and shared records, the start date is calculated automatically from the actual training start and cannot be edited."},buttons:{save:"Save",cancel:"Cancel",back:"Back",addRecord:"Add",extractData:"Extract data",filter:"Filter",addProvider:"Add",delete:"Delete"},evaluate:{actionLabel:"Evaluate"},approve:{actionButton:"Approve",successToast:"Record approved",errorToast:"Error approving record"},reject:{actionButton:"Reject",confirmButton:"Reject record",modalTitle:"Reject record",justificationLabel:"Justification",justificationPlaceholder:"Describe the reason for rejection",successToast:"Record rejected",errorToast:"Error rejecting record"},statusBanner:{rejectedTitle:"Learning record rejected",emittedTitle:"Certificate approved",approvedTitle:"Learning record approved"},massActions:{approve:{label:"Approve records",toastTitle:"Records approved",confirmation:{message:"Approve {{count}} selected record(s)?",note:"Only pending external records will be approved. Others will be ignored."}},send_email:{label:"Send email",toastTitle:"Sending email",emailTitle:{label:"Email title",placeholder:"Enter the email title",maxLength:"The title must be at most 150 characters"},testEmail:{button:"Send test email",success:"Test email sent to you.",error:"Could not send the test email.",emptyContent:"Write the email content before sending the test."},confirmation:{message:"Send the email to {{count}} selected record(s)?",note:"Anyone without a registered email will be skipped."}},resend_signature_email:{label:"Resend certificate signature email",toastTitle:"Signature email resend in progress",tooltip:"Available only when the content owner signature is enabled",confirmation:{message:"Resend the signature email to {{count}} selected record(s)?",note:"Only those who still owe their own signature will receive the email. The others will be ignored."}},reject:{label:"Re